# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# full-stack branch
#
# This branch is the complete monorepo: everything on `main` plus the
# development material that main leaves out.
#
#   brand/      brand kit and assets (also on `assets/brandkit`)
#   frontend/   Next.js explorer dashboard
#   tasks/      internal working notes
#   reference/  architecture docs + external repo clones
#
# `main` is the self-hostable subset — facilitator, mcp-server, packages,
# deploy, examples — and gitignores the four directories above. The two
# branches intentionally differ here; do not merge main's version over this.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Reference clones (external repos, tracked upstream — not vendored here)
/reference/x402/
/reference/x402-stellar/
/reference/x402scan/
/reference/stellar-docs/
/reference/stellar-contracts/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Dependencies / build output
node_modules/
dist/
target/
.next/
out/
coverage/
*.log

# Local environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Example apps pull their own dependencies
/examples/*/node_modules/
